{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Find, approach and take object. Then, check properties. If not found, search again. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    />  <Action ID = ApproachObject    />  <Action ID = SearchForObject    />   <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    />  <Condition ID = IsObjectFound    />   <SubTree ID = MobileRobotTask    />\"",
    "BT": {
        "Blackboard": [
